---
description: Core business logic package rules
globs: app/core/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# @pig-agents/core

- Pure Node/TS — no `electron`, no `express`, no DOM.
- All workspace paths via `safeJoin()`; escaping workspace must throw.
- Platform-specific shell/command hints belong in callers (electron), not hardcoded `bash` only.
- Keep modules small: `workspace`, `logger`, later `agent`, `tools`, `llm`.
